summary:
  A guess that looks like a sibling edge is accepted even when its answer came
  from somewhere else.

history:
  Qt follows redirects by itself. An address that has the right shape and
  hands the listener on to another host has proven nothing about whose stream
  plays.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
      return mountTwin(savedUrl, (landedUrl || "") === "" ? guessUrl : landedUrl);

replace:
      return mountTwin(savedUrl, guessUrl) || mountTwin(savedUrl, landedUrl);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_heallogic.qml::test_a_guess_is_taken_only_when_it_lands_on_the_twin.
  Line-neutral.
